# AI Architecture

Implement a LangGraph-based multi-agent architecture.

Requirements:

* Supervisor Agent for orchestration
* Node-based workflow
* Separate `agents` folder
* Identify and implement all the agents required for the business use case
* Each agent implemented in a separate file
* MCP tools attached to the respective agents wherever applicable
* Dynamic agent selection
* Parallel execution wherever possible
* Perform RAG retrieval through agent when required.
* Add a planner agent at start
* Before returning the final response add Hallucination Detection, Final response validation, Audit trail validation, Reflection Agent and memory agent.

Support:
* Summary dashboard
* Analysis pages
* Implementation pages
* Text Chat
* Voice Chat (STT/TTS)
* Vision
* OCR
* Vector Embeddings

